# `SELECT` in capitals after the table, without `|` (DS0153).
mode: syntax
---- query
from t SELECT a
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..16
  PIPELINE@0..15
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    NAME_REF@5..6
      IDENT@5..6 "t"
    WHITESPACE@6..7 " "
    PROJECT_OP@7..15
      IDENT@7..13 "SELECT"
      WHITESPACE@13..14 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@14..15
        NAME_REF@14..15
          IDENT@14..15 "a"
  WHITESPACE@15..16 "\n"

error[DS0153]: `SELECT` is SQL: DataScript pipes the table into an operator
  --> query:1:8
  |
1 | from t SELECT a
  |        ^^^^^^ expected `|` before this
  |
  = help: pipe the rows into `project`: `| project`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from t | project a
which parses without errors
